WEBVTT

00:26:58.938 --> 00:27:01.011
that will be a nirvana for introverts,

00:27:01.035 --> 00:27:03.060
so I want to see what they're doing right.

00:27:03.084 --> 00:27:06.132
And the first thing I found is that,
in company after company,

00:27:06.156 --> 00:27:09.893
they were all situated
in these big, open office plans,

00:27:09.917 --> 00:27:12.134
with, really, no space to get away.

00:27:12.158 --> 00:27:18.785
And in those days, it was really not OK
to critique that type of plan.

00:27:18.809 --> 00:27:21.966
So, these people I was interviewing
would kind of whisper to me

00:27:21.990 --> 00:27:25.970
and tell me, you know, "I can't focus.
I can't get anything done.

00:27:25.994 --> 00:27:27.622
But I don't want to tell my boss,

00:27:27.646 --> 00:27:30.436
because I'm afraid
I won't be seen as a team player."